# Requires maintainer review before merge for anything that can affect
# which skills the runtime treats as trusted/bundled vs. untrusted. A plain
# SHA-256 manifest has no secret key -- anyone who can push a poisoned skill
# file *and* a matching regenerated MANIFEST.json in the same commit can
# make the runtime treat it as official. This file is the actual control
# against that, not secrecy of the hashing script.
#
# user_skills/ is intentionally NOT listed here -- it's meant to be freely
# user-editable, and edits there are correctly routed through the untrusted-
# skill scanner at runtime regardless of who touches them.

/radiant_llm_skills/       @zavierndum
/maintenance_scripts/      @zavierndum
